  "instance_name": "primate_stereotype",
  "label": "Primate Stereotype",
  "description": "The meme relies on the stereotype that primates, particularly baboons, are unintelligent or primitive, which is used humorously to imply that the subjects (the baboons) are confused or misled. This stereotype is often used in real-world contexts to demean or dehumanize people, especially Black people, by comparing them to primates. The humor in the meme is derived from this implicit association, even though it is not explicitly stated.",
